Package: termux-mcp
Version: 0.14.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Twilight <twilight@aliveos.org>
Depends: python, python-pip
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/termuxgpt/termux-mcp
Description: Termux REST API daemon + native MCP server for AI agents
 Lightweight HTTP server running inside Termux, exposing shell
 execution and device capabilities as a streaming API for AI agents
 and LLM tool-calling. Ships both 'termux-mcp' (REST on :8080) and
 'termux-native-mcp' (Model Context Protocol on :8081 / stdio).
